## Intelligence Engine

![Profit Chart](/images/projects/procurement-and-inventory-analytics-system/profit-chart.png)

High-performance SQL aggregation engine for calculating real-time profit margins across mining inventory.

---

## Data Architecture

![Schema Diagram](/images/projects/procurement-and-inventory-analytics-system/schema-diagram.png)

The system relies on a strict relational schema to ensure auditability. Every purchase action triggers a JSON-based log entry (`pembelian_logs`), creating an immutable history of vendor interactions and price changes.

---

## Standardization Protocols

![Trait System](/images/projects/procurement-and-inventory-analytics-system/trait-system.png)

To maintain API consistency across the platform, I implemented a custom `ApiValidation` trait. This ensures all endpoints return standardized JSON error responses (Status 422) without repetitive controller logic.